<h1>Josina Morita</h1>
<p>Cook County Commissioner, 13th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.josinamorita.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (josinamorita.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Her campaign site lists justice reform, an environmental justice policy for the county, health equity, language access, small business and housing investment, transit expansion, and veterans funding as its issue areas. It also emphasizes passing balanced budgets without new taxes during her first term.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Urban planner and nonprofit leader for more than 20 years before joining the board, and the first Asian American woman to serve on it.</p>
